 V-domain diagnostic boundary, not direct 3.3 V GPIO. Switch PG means enhanced FET, not valid output voltage." (at 20.32 322.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1f812c2f-6cf9-5bac-9abd-ed98f4b4d429")) (text "No branch current limiting, reverse blocking or arbitrary-brownout hold-up is supplied by this block.\nCTSW1 requires >=470 nF effective; CTSUP1 >=1.2 uF effective. Values and timing require qualified parts/tests.\nSBC total charge capacitance <=1 mF; host current <=3 A. No alternative USB/SBC power source until backfeed is reviewed.\nNo machine permission follows from power return. Circuit ERC is not PCB or physical qualification." (at 20.32 375.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7f2f0075-1042-5b3d-8451-2ee26dfdb313")))
